      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gamerco%2C_New_Mexico",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "At its peak, about 500 coal miners and their families called Gamerco home.",
